        "system": {
          "details": {
            "level": {
              "value": 12
            },
            "publicNotes": "<h2>The Grasping Regret — Creature 12</h2><p><b>Medium demon, fiend, unholy</b> • spectral skirmisher • <b>AC</b> 34; <b>HP</b> 205; <b>Fort</b> +22, <b>Ref</b> +26, <b>Will</b> +21; <b>Perception</b> +22; <b>Speed</b> 35 feet, fly 35 feet.</p><p>A creature made of scenes that should have ended differently. Its many hands clutch at the victim’s unresolved mistakes. Each injury is to identity rather than flesh.</p><p><b>Use:</b> one creature at a time, skirmish and force Reflex checks. Never use ordinary attack damage against PCs. The creature’s HP is spectral coherence.</p>",
            "privateNotes": "GM: Signature ability uses the Abyssal Erosion dashboard. These monsters deal Erosion rather than HP damage. Their HP represents spectral coherence while PCs fight them.",
            "alliance": "opposition"
          },
