        "items": [
          {
            "name": "Grasp of What Was",
            "type": "action",
            "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
            "system": {
              "actionType": {
                "value": "action"
              },
              "actions": {
                "value": 2
              },
              "category": "offensive",
              "description": {
                "value": "<p><b>Emotion, mental, fear, Erosion • 30 feet • Reflex DC 32.</b> A wave of grasping hands made of missed opportunities. <b>Critical success/success</b> no effect; <b>failure</b> 1 Erosion; <b>critical failure</b> 2 Erosion and immobilized until the end of the victim’s next turn (Escape DC 32). Once per target per round. <b>Use the Erosion dashboard to roll and apply.</b></p>"
              },
              "traits": {
                "value": []
              },
              "rules": []
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Slip Between Regrets",
            "type": "action",
            "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
            "system": {
              "actionType": {
                "value": "action"
              },
              "actions": {
                "value": 1
              },
              "category": "offensive",
              "description": {
                "value": "<p>The Regret Flies or Steps up to half its speed, passing through narrow spaces as an image; it cannot end within a solid object. This is purely positioning, not automatic incorporeal immunity.</p>"
              },
              "traits": {
                "value": []
              },
              "rules": []
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Echo of the Unsaid",
            "type": "action",
            "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
            "system": {
              "actionType": {
                "value": "action"
              },
              "actions": {
                "value": 1
              },
              "category": "offensive",
              "description": {
                "value": "<p><b>Emotion, mental • 30 feet.</b> A victim hears words they regret. The target becomes off-guard to the Regret until the beginning of its next turn unless it spends 1 action voicing something it wishes it had said. No additional Erosion. GM adjudicates immunity to repeated attempts.</p>"
              },
              "traits": {
                "value": []
              },
              "rules": []
            }
          }
        ],
