            },
            "publicNotes": "<h2>The Hollow One — Creature 13</h2><p><b>Medium demon, fiend, unholy</b> • spectral endurance predator • <b>AC</b> 35; <b>HP</b> 240; <b>Fort</b> +28, <b>Ref</b> +21, <b>Will</b> +24; <b>Perception</b> +23; <b>Speed</b> 25 feet, fly 25 feet.</p><p>A perfectly still absence wearing the shape of someone who stopped feeling. It wins by waiting until nothing matters.</p><p><b>Use:</b> one creature alone = moderate encounter for four level-13 PCs by XP, but Erosion can make it dangerous. Its HP represents coherence. No damaging Strikes.</p>",
