              "category": "offensive",
              "description": {
                "value": "<p><b>Emotion, mental • 30 feet • single target • Fortitude DC 34.</b> The airless emptiness collapses on a soul. <b>Critical success/success</b> no Erosion; <b>failure</b> 1 Erosion; <b>critical failure</b> 2 Erosion and fatigued until the end of the encounter. Once per target per round. <b>Use the Erosion dashboard.</b></p>"
