              "category": "offensive",
              "description": {
                "value": "<p>The Hollow One stands still and gains a +2 circumstance bonus to AC until its next turn. If an adjacent creature voluntarily stops speaking or moving in its presence, the Hollow One may instead Step 5 feet. No HP damage.</p>"
              },
              "traits": {
