              "category": "offensive",
              "description": {
                "value": "<p><b>Emotion, mental • 15 feet • Fortitude DC 34.</b> One target can choose not to resist: it suppresses frightened or stupefied until the end of its next turn but willingly takes 1 Erosion. If it resists, this ability has no effect. This is an explicit temptation rather than a save-forced loss.</p>"
