            "publicNotes": "<h2>Mirror of Longing — Creature 14</h2><p><b>Medium demon, fiend, unholy</b> • psychological controller • <b>AC</b> 37; <b>HP</b> 258; <b>Fort</b> +23, <b>Ref</b> +27, <b>Will</b> +29; <b>Perception</b> +28; <b>Speed</b> 30 feet, fly 30 feet.</p><p>It reflects the person the victim most wishes to see. Its kindness is a trap: it is a perfected reflection of something that never existed.</p><p><b>Use:</b> it rolls Deception +31 against its target’s Perception DC. The dashboard automates this check and Erosion on the affected PC.</p>",
